# cases the riscv32 column builds and diffs but does not run: a case name per line,
# then the reason. the golden still carries the column; only the differential under
# qemu-riscv32 is skipped, because the compiler's answer is known to be wrong today.
# entries are written out by name so a case added later inherits nothing.
#
# every entry is a MACH DEFECT, names its issue, and is deleted by the change
# that closes it. the run still executes each one and fails when it agrees with
# the reference, so a line cannot outlive its defect. the reason names the
# probe that isolates the family this file was written against; a case is
# attributed to the family only where its source carries the pattern the probe
# isolates, otherwise it is unattributed and the fix for #3616 re-runs it. the
# u64-index family (#3615) this file once named is fixed; the cases it left
# still disagreeing are listed unattributed.
#
#   SUB-WORD WIDEN (#3616). `var a: u8 = 240 + s; a = a + 8; a::u64` yields
#   0x108: the widening emits no mask, so wrapped u8/u16 arithmetic leaks its
#   carry bits.
#
# 88 of the 110 cases that build pass the differential at o0 and o2.

